(1886006, 259477, 47487, '<td valign="top">I think maybe the plastic knife detracts from the photo a bit -- I find myself wondering what''s on it. Otherwise a well-composed, technically good image, and a creative idea. I like the ''just pulled it out of the fridge in a moment of temptation'' look. I''m quite familiar with that myself. :)</td>', 'I think maybe the plastic knife detracts from the photo a bit -- I find myself wondering what''s on it. Otherwise a well-composed, technically good image, and a creative idea. I like the ''just pulled it out of the fridge in a moment of temptation'' look. I''m quite familiar with that myself. :)', '2005-11-21 00:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886010, 260145, 15711, '<td valign="top">Kevin is that you???  Really a nice take.  Lots of card stuff in this challenge, but this is well executed and clever.</td>', 'Kevin is that you???  Really a nice take.  Lots of card stuff in this challenge, but this is well executed and clever.', '2005-11-21 00:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
