(1886228, 258021, 29269, '<td valign="top">I left a comment on another ace in the sleeve photo suggesting that the lighting should have been more subdued, with the focus on the ace in the sleeve. Now this image leaves me without an option. Got to give you 10.</td>', 'I left a comment on another ace in the sleeve photo suggesting that the lighting should have been more subdued, with the focus on the ace in the sleeve. Now this image leaves me without an option. Got to give you 10.', '2005-11-21 01:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
