(1886270, 259696, 47487, '<td valign="top">I didn''t ''get'' this one at first, but then I realized that that was a snowball and he was running away from a snowball fight. Clever. I hope everyone else ''gets'' it as well. :)</td>', 'I didn''t ''get'' this one at first, but then I realized that that was a snowball and he was running away from a snowball fight. Clever. I hope everyone else ''gets'' it as well. :)', '2005-11-21 01:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
