(1888447, 259736, 42714, '<td valign="top">Love the concept, I''ve seen so many card/die pictures but this does something different.  Two things I would recommend...first, technically the image is too grey..perhaps messing with your aperture/exposure would help.  Second is compositionally....one thing to consider helping with the balance of your photograph is perhaps showing a bit more of that drill bit - showing the length of it and giving some more empty/black space could make it even more potent.</td>', 'Love the concept, I''ve seen so many card/die pictures but this does something different.  Two things I would recommend...first, technically the image is too grey..perhaps messing with your aperture/exposure would help.  Second is compositionally....one thing to consider helping with the balance of your photograph is perhaps showing a bit more of that drill bit - showing the length of it and giving some more empty/black space could make it even more potent.', '2005-11-21 22:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888457, 260171, 42714, '<td valign="top">Very charming, love the touch with the glasses tilted off of the nose,. caught in the act.  By the way, great DOF, color, and all-around composition.</td>', 'Very charming, love the touch with the glasses tilted off of the nose,. caught in the act.  By the way, great DOF, color, and all-around composition.', '2005-11-21 22:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888458, 260153, 42714, '<td valign="top">Why didn''t I think of this in school?  Chew the evidence!</td>', 'Why didn''t I think of this in school?  Chew the evidence!', '2005-11-21 22:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888467, 259120, 42714, '<td valign="top">Wicked depth of field, just wicked.  Love how you''re using elements that are still recognizeable out of focus such as the pens and scantron.</td>', 'Wicked depth of field, just wicked.  Love how you''re using elements that are still recognizeable out of focus such as the pens and scantron.', '2005-11-21 22:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888477, 259735, 42714, '<td valign="top">That''s just brilliant.  Great composition, though I do have to question the addition of what seems to be a bright sepia, think it would even more strongly as B&amp;W.  Regardless, this is one of the best I''ve seen in this challenge.  LOVE the tight crop.</td>', 'That''s just brilliant.  Great composition, though I do have to question the addition of what seems to be a bright sepia, think it would even more strongly as B&W.  Regardless, this is one of the best I''ve seen in this challenge.  LOVE the tight crop.', '2005-11-21 22:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888528, 260097, 42567, '<td valign="top">How cute..!!!!!</td>', 'How cute..!!!!!', '2005-11-21 22:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888646, 259857, 46737, '<td valign="top">Great shot, really original. Thanks for not taking a picture of a poker player cheating.</td>', 'Great shot, really original. Thanks for not taking a picture of a poker player cheating.', '2005-11-22 00:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888677, 260139, 15511, '<td valign="top">Cool, very cool. <br/>Doesn''t display cheating, though.</td>', 'Cool, very cool. Doesn''t display cheating, though.', '2005-11-22 00:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888749, 260137, 44860, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I suppose you were using polarizing filter to reduce reflection...10</td>', 'Very nice. I suppose you were using polarizing filter to reduce reflection...10', '2005-11-22 01:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888751, 259735, 44860, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like a warm sephia color cast...10</td>', 'Very nice, I like a warm sephia color cast...10', '2005-11-22 01:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888756, 260043, 44860, '<td valign="top">Very clear and colourful.</td>', 'Very clear and colourful.', '2005-11-22 01:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888761, 260115, 44860, '<td valign="top">Straight flash makes a photo look snapshot-like. Bounced flash would make it much better...5</td>', 'Straight flash makes a photo look snapshot-like. Bounced flash would make it much better...5', '2005-11-22 01:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888764, 260138, 44860, '<td valign="top">Original idea! Not an ace in a sleeve or answers written on palm. What a refresh :) ...9</td>', 'Original idea! Not an ace in a sleeve or answers written on palm. What a refresh :) ...9', '2005-11-22 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888780, 259889, 46117, '<td valign="top">Why is the writing on her leg made with a pen and she has a pencil in her hand? ;)</td>', 'Why is the writing on her leg made with a pen and she has a pencil in her hand? ;)', '2005-11-22 02:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888918, 259889, 46920, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model...beautiful cheating.  A unique shot.</td>', 'Beautiful model...beautiful cheating.  A unique shot.', '2005-11-22 06:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888920, 258822, 44860, '<td valign="top">It took a second to realize idea of cheating. I always like non trivial ideas. Nicely done...8</td>', 'It took a second to realize idea of cheating. I always like non trivial ideas. Nicely done...8', '2005-11-22 07:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888922, 259619, 44860, '<td valign="top">Do you treat using sources cheating while solving crosswords?</td>', 'Do you treat using sources cheating while solving crosswords?', '2005-11-22 07:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888923, 258792, 44860, '<td valign="top">Well done. Nicely prepared...8</td>', 'Well done. Nicely prepared...8', '2005-11-22 07:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888926, 260137, 46920, '<td valign="top">Wow, they do look like they are floating on air.  A deceptive photograph.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow, they do look like they are floating on air.  A deceptive photograph.  Well done.', '2005-11-22 07:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888930, 260180, 44860, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Where''s cheating?</td>', 'Nice colors. Where''s cheating?', '2005-11-22 07:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
