(1889396, 258701, 43565, '<td valign="top">Are you cheating because that is not really Bush, because you''re a Republican and neither of you are good for the country, you''re a Democrat and would not be near Bush?  Not really sure what you are trying to say here.  As a photo, I think it looks more like a snapshot and the background is too busy.</td>', 'Are you cheating because that is not really Bush, because you''re a Republican and neither of you are good for the country, you''re a Democrat and would not be near Bush?  Not really sure what you are trying to say here.  As a photo, I think it looks more like a snapshot and the background is too busy.', '2005-11-22 12:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889397, 259508, 43565, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the background is way too busy IMO.</td>', 'Good idea, but the background is way too busy IMO.', '2005-11-22 12:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889422, 258907, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t get how this is cheating.</td>', 'I don''t get how this is cheating.', '2005-11-22 12:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
