(1893550, 260177, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a great idea for this challenge!  like the composition of this shot very much.  it''s hard to see what she''s holding against the dark cabinets...perhaps a lighter colored cookie would have stood out more?  such a sweet composition.</td>', 'what a great idea for this challenge!  like the composition of this shot very much.  it''s hard to see what she''s holding against the dark cabinets...perhaps a lighter colored cookie would have stood out more?  such a sweet composition.', '2005-11-23 17:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
