(1893553, 260076, 37875, '<td valign="top">ha!  don''t even have to work for it.  : )<br/>love the baby cub with his toungue sticking out!  also like the grainy feel to this photo, it lends a sort of nostalgic feel to the photo in a way.</td>', 'ha!  don''t even have to work for it.  : )love the baby cub with his toungue sticking out!  also like the grainy feel to this photo, it lends a sort of nostalgic feel to the photo in a way.', '2005-11-23 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893554, 259477, 37875, '<td valign="top">ha!  : )<br/>like the fat burner in the background.  the lighting is a bit harsh, imo, and i would have liked to see this taken from a higher angle i think...but a great idea for this challenge.</td>', 'ha!  : )like the fat burner in the background.  the lighting is a bit harsh, imo, and i would have liked to see this taken from a higher angle i think...but a great idea for this challenge.', '2005-11-23 17:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
