(1893571, 259091, 37875, '<td valign="top">lovely wintery photo.  nice dof.  i have to say i don''t quite understand how a winter rose is a cheater...but the photo appeals to me.</td>', 'lovely wintery photo.  nice dof.  i have to say i don''t quite understand how a winter rose is a cheater...but the photo appeals to me.', '2005-11-23 17:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
