(1895295, 259692, 13688, '<td valign="top">if the steam is real i''m very impressed.  I had trouble getting coffee to steam.  sorry but it looks like it was dodged in :(  I like your composition other than the excess space at the top...especially the choice for the half eaten one.  Hope the comments help in some way.</td>', 'if the steam is real i''m very impressed.  I had trouble getting coffee to steam.  sorry but it looks like it was dodged in :(  I like your composition other than the excess space at the top...especially the choice for the half eaten one.  Hope the comments help in some way.', '2005-11-24 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
