(1896033, 259498, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good ''clean'' shot, nice colors.  Criticism; for the Challenge maybe a bit ''obvious'' but minor.  Maybe a slightly different angle/crop, not sure, like how this shows the length of the lane, etc.</td>', '7 - Good ''clean'' shot, nice colors.  Criticism; for the Challenge maybe a bit ''obvious'' but minor.  Maybe a slightly different angle/crop, not sure, like how this shows the length of the lane, etc.', '2005-11-24 22:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896034, 260153, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good meet of the Challenge, nice ''clean'' feel.  Criticism; maybe a touch ''busy'' but that''s part of the ''scene'' so who knows.</td>', '8 - Good meet of the Challenge, nice ''clean'' feel.  Criticism; maybe a touch ''busy'' but that''s part of the ''scene'' so who knows.', '2005-11-24 22:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896037, 260080, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good.  Criticism; maybe the focus a little different, not sure, just like to be able to see the ''hole'' more - maybe different angle, tighter crop may have made this better in my opinion.  Good effort.</td>', '8 - Good.  Criticism; maybe the focus a little different, not sure, just like to be able to see the ''hole'' more - maybe different angle, tighter crop may have made this better in my opinion.  Good effort.', '2005-11-24 22:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896039, 259735, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good idea and meet of the Challenge with a unique ''non adulterous'' factor.  Criticism; toning works but I wonder if b/w would have worked better, just seems a bit of a ''tinge'' to this.  Maybe even a small frame may have made this even better in my opinion, not sure.</td>', '8 - Good idea and meet of the Challenge with a unique ''non adulterous'' factor.  Criticism; toning works but I wonder if b/w would have worked better, just seems a bit of a ''tinge'' to this.  Maybe even a small frame may have made this even better in my opinion, not sure.', '2005-11-24 22:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896045, 258456, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like it.  Criticism; not much, maybe a sharper angle/perspective, or even trying to ''scale'' this, may have made it even better in my opinion.  Good idea that without the quality wouldn''t have worked.</td>', '7 - Like it.  Criticism; not much, maybe a sharper angle/perspective, or even trying to ''scale'' this, may have made it even better in my opinion.  Good idea that without the quality wouldn''t have worked.', '2005-11-24 22:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896053, 258942, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like it.  Criticism; maybe color would be better, especially as seems to be an issue in the blacks/gamma.  Like the sharp perspective, not sure on the rotation.  The man in the background adds context, but his ''pose'' doesn''t add to the effect in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '7 - Like it.  Criticism; maybe color would be better, especially as seems to be an issue in the blacks/gamma.  Like the sharp perspective, not sure on the rotation.  The man in the background adds context, but his ''pose'' doesn''t add to the effect in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.', '2005-11-24 22:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896063, 258878, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the concept, good ''catch''.  Criticism; difficult, but the coloring/lighting adds to a snapshot ''feel'' in my opinion.  Perhaps a different (sharper) angle and slightly different crop, and adjusting the tones/colors, may have given this a little ''extra'', including drama, and made it better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Like the concept, good ''catch''.  Criticism; difficult, but the coloring/lighting adds to a snapshot ''feel'' in my opinion.  Perhaps a different (sharper) angle and slightly different crop, and adjusting the tones/colors, may have given this a little ''extra'', including drama, and made it better in my opinion.', '2005-11-24 22:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896067, 259128, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the concept, good idea.  Criticism; difficult, but slightly closer if possible, would have made this better in my opinion, &amp;/or a different angle, especially to ''cut out'' the leaves.  Maybe even a small frame in this case may have helped, not sure.</td>', '5 - Like the concept, good idea.  Criticism; difficult, but slightly closer if possible, would have made this better in my opinion, &/or a different angle, especially to ''cut out'' the leaves.  Maybe even a small frame in this case may have helped, not sure.', '2005-11-24 22:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896072, 260171, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very Funny.  Thanks for the laugh.  Criticism; not much at all, I like the whole set up, composition colors, background, pose, etc.  Maybe to really nit-pick the book placed differently but trivial.  Seems slight issues with the green on the wallpaper(?), but could be my monitor.  Ok, maybe she could have something ''written'' on the paper for added effect, but again minor.  Well done.  Up to 9 from 8. edit:typo &amp; congratulations<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-08 18:51:35.</i></td>', '9 - Very Funny.  Thanks for the laugh.  Criticism; not much at all, I like the whole set up, composition colors, background, pose, etc.  Maybe to really nit-pick the book placed differently but trivial.  Seems slight issues with the green on the wallpaper(?), but could be my monitor.  Ok, maybe she could have something ''written'' on the paper for added effect, but again minor.  Well done.  Up to 9 from 8. edit:typo & congratulations', '2005-11-24 22:49:17.000000', '2005-12-08 18:51:35.000000', 1),
(1896096, 259823, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like it, poor dog, like the matching cards.  Criticism; looks ''snapshottish'', so if you had the chance, maybe a sharper angle, different lighting, or just something to create the ''illusion'' would have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Like it, poor dog, like the matching cards.  Criticism; looks ''snapshottish'', so if you had the chance, maybe a sharper angle, different lighting, or just something to create the ''illusion'' would have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-11-24 22:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
