(1900981, 259735, 29269, '<td valign="top">It''s a classic! One of those, why didn''t I think of this! photos. Would have worked even better with adult models, but it is sweet enough like this too.<br/> <br/>Sweet - bumping up.</td>', 'It''s a classic! One of those, why didn''t I think of this! photos. Would have worked even better with adult models, but it is sweet enough like this too. Sweet - bumping up.', '2005-11-27 22:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1900984, 259750, 35078, '<td valign="top">Had to look twice. I was focusing on the nice girl in the foreground!</td>', 'Had to look twice. I was focusing on the nice girl in the foreground!', '2005-11-27 22:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1900985, 260127, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good colors. Some may tell you they are over done, but for the type of pic here, I think they are just right. I see a celebration of the absurd in the cheating woman. The color enhances the experience.  Well done.</td>', 'Good colors. Some may tell you they are over done, but for the type of pic here, I think they are just right. I see a celebration of the absurd in the cheating woman. The color enhances the experience.  Well done.', '2005-11-27 22:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1900988, 259744, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I was wondering if someone would show cheating DPC style, and this is it! No way this will be DQd, as the image revolves around the hand deleting the image. Wonderful, artful yet artistic. Good luck!<br/> <br/>Bumping up after comparing to the rest of the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice! I was wondering if someone would show cheating DPC style, and this is it! No way this will be DQd, as the image revolves around the hand deleting the image. Wonderful, artful yet artistic. Good luck! Bumping up after comparing to the rest of the challenge.', '2005-11-27 22:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1900989, 258792, 35078, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!</td>', 'Cool idea!', '2005-11-27 22:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1900996, 260080, 33400, '<td valign="top">Lot of work in this one.  Good central focus and very obvious challenge requirements - even without the title.</td>', 'Lot of work in this one.  Good central focus and very obvious challenge requirements - even without the title.', '2005-11-27 22:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901000, 258822, 29269, '<td valign="top">I used to take a screwdriver and work on my Rubic''s cube in the beginning... that would have scored a point higher with me. Still, nice take on the challenge. A more subtle dividing line in the background would have been better but it is very good as is. <br/> <br/>Final bump-up.</td>', 'I used to take a screwdriver and work on my Rubic''s cube in the beginning... that would have scored a point higher with me. Still, nice take on the challenge. A more subtle dividing line in the background would have been better but it is very good as is.  Final bump-up.', '2005-11-27 22:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901001, 258456, 33400, '<td valign="top">Great use of the absurd.  This is a good way to make a difficult challenge work - without playing cards, dice, or crib notes. Congratulations.</td>', 'Great use of the absurd.  This is a good way to make a difficult challenge work - without playing cards, dice, or crib notes. Congratulations.', '2005-11-27 22:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901005, 260145, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and an overal well balanced shot.  Congratulations also on an "original" version of the cheating ace.</td>', 'Good lighting and an overal well balanced shot.  Congratulations also on an "original" version of the cheating ace.', '2005-11-27 22:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901012, 259886, 35078, '<td valign="top">He must be the worst cheater in history, or the dealer is blind! Good shot anyway.</td>', 'He must be the worst cheater in history, or the dealer is blind! Good shot anyway.', '2005-11-27 22:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901024, 258622, 33400, '<td valign="top">Lots of good elements in the contrast here.  I had to keep looking at it and finally come back to make a comment.<br/>Technically, I wish his/her face was better focused. But the attention to detail is excellent.<br/>I see: one man hand and one very female woman hand, a manly face, breasts, and eye shadow and liner on manly eyes.<br/>Good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Lots of good elements in the contrast here.  I had to keep looking at it and finally come back to make a comment.Technically, I wish his/her face was better focused. But the attention to detail is excellent.I see: one man hand and one very female woman hand, a manly face, breasts, and eye shadow and liner on manly eyes.Good take on the challenge.', '2005-11-27 22:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901027, 258822, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good idea. The reflection helps to make it interesting.  Very good take on the challenge. Congratulations on no dice, aces, or crib notes.</td>', 'Good idea. The reflection helps to make it interesting.  Very good take on the challenge. Congratulations on no dice, aces, or crib notes.', '2005-11-27 22:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
