(1901254, 259133, 47487, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the helpful and friendly comments on my image. I''m just pleased to be in the top half, percentile-wise. :)<br/> <br/>I especially liked the comments from people who did this themselves as children. I did too -- but in our house, now, it''s not really necessary. We''re homeschoolers, and as such we generally don''t have a set waking-up time (well, Dad does, as he has to get to work, but the kids don''t) and thus both our kids are allowed to read as late as they want at night without having to hide under the covers. My son was happy to pretend he was breaking a rule in order to be my model for this challenge, however. :)</td>', 'Thank you for all the helpful and friendly comments on my image. I''m just pleased to be in the top half, percentile-wise. :) I especially liked the comments from people who did this themselves as children. I did too -- but in our house, now, it''s not really necessary. We''re homeschoolers, and as such we generally don''t have a set waking-up time (well, Dad does, as he has to get to work, but the kids don''t) and thus both our kids are allowed to read as late as they want at night without having to hide under the covers. My son was happy to pretend he was breaking a rule in order to be my model for this challenge, however. :)', '2005-11-28 00:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
