(1901757, 259900, 30049, '<td valign="top">Thanks Ken.  I can still call you Ken can''t I?  ;^)<br/> <br/>Wow!  Worst one ever for me score wise.  Oh well...it''s funny, I couldn''t get past the vision of kids at a desk, or card cheating so I wasn''t going to enter.  Then last day of the challenge deadline I was out in the yard dealing with these leaves, thinking to myself - thank goodness for this mulching machine.  Then thought about how it was kind of taking the easy way out..bingo, cheating!  Grabbed the camera and the rest is history.  ;^)<br/> <br/>Oh, if you come back to read this Jeannel (tpoc), there was 30 minutes of daylight left...can''t get much later day sun than that.  He-he.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh Chit! You got slapped in this one. Good photo, but probably a limited audience for the specific punch line. :) </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thanks Ken.  I can still call you Ken can''t I?  ;^) Wow!  Worst one ever for me score wise.  Oh well...it''s funny, I couldn''t get past the vision of kids at a desk, or card cheating so I wasn''t going to enter.  Then last day of the challenge deadline I was out in the yard dealing with these leaves, thinking to myself - thank goodness for this mulching machine.  Then thought about how it was kind of taking the easy way out..bingo, cheating!  Grabbed the camera and the rest is history.  ;^) Oh, if you come back to read this Jeannel (tpoc), there was 30 minutes of daylight left...can''t get much later day sun than that.  He-he. Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Oh Chit! You got slapped in this one. Good photo, but probably a limited audience for the specific punch line. :) ', '2005-11-28 08:12:26.000000', NULL, 0),
