(1902396, 260142, 33068, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your high placing.  Once again you''ve raised the stakes by adding your creative and edgy style to another work of art. I enjoy watching what you''ll come up with each challenge.  <br/> <br/>btw.....I want those legs!</td>', 'Congrats on your high placing.  Once again you''ve raised the stakes by adding your creative and edgy style to another work of art. I enjoy watching what you''ll come up with each challenge.   btw.....I want those legs!', '2005-11-28 14:22:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1902514, 260171, 13381, '<td valign="top">Wow, a great idea, and awesome execution.  I''m always pleased to see the clever ideas you come up with. Congratulations!</td>', 'Wow, a great idea, and awesome execution.  I''m always pleased to see the clever ideas you come up with. Congratulations!', '2005-11-28 15:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1902537, 259889, 43809, '<td valign="top">Rolles and Lagranges theorem...<br/>bingo i guess<br/>n the first one is the concept of differentiation<br/>grt pic btw</td>', 'Rolles and Lagranges theorem...bingo i guessn the first one is the concept of differentiationgrt pic btw', '2005-11-28 15:23:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1902566, 259889, 40181, '<td valign="top">1st one is the definition of a derivative<br/> <br/>2nd is the mean value theorem<br/> <br/>3rd one is difficult to see but I''m pretty sure it''s the first fundamental theorem of calculus... I''m assuming that should F(b) - F(a), not f(b) - F(a).</td>', '1st one is the definition of a derivative 2nd is the mean value theorem 3rd one is difficult to see but I''m pretty sure it''s the first fundamental theorem of calculus... I''m assuming that should F(b) - F(a), not f(b) - F(a).', '2005-11-28 15:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1902570, 260171, 10080, '<td valign="top">Another great job Shannon. I didn''t pick this one as yours, but thats what gets you the ribbons. Wonderful ideas, great execution, and variety! Congrats!</td>', 'Another great job Shannon. I didn''t pick this one as yours, but thats what gets you the ribbons. Wonderful ideas, great execution, and variety! Congrats!', '2005-11-28 15:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
