(1903523, 259508, 42198, '<td valign="top">Hi Kita, congratulations on another great shot!<br/> <br/>I think this would have done even better if you''d had the boy in front in focus (that''s the only reason it lost a point with me) - But 5.326 is a pretty good score.<br/> <br/>Plus you beat your mum....  :)</td>', 'Hi Kita, congratulations on another great shot! I think this would have done even better if you''d had the boy in front in focus (that''s the only reason it lost a point with me) - But 5.326 is a pretty good score. Plus you beat your mum....  :)', '2005-11-28 22:05:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1903533, 259513, 42198, '<td valign="top">So Kita beat you again?  :) (Left a comment on her shot btw)<br/> <br/>I think this would have worked better if his t-shirt had been all light grey. As it stands, it ''mixes in'' with your dress half-way down. The lighting is a bit harsh as well, especially on the left of the man. Was this on-camera flash?<br/> <br/>Good idea though, and it was a refreshing change from the other entries in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'So Kita beat you again?  :) (Left a comment on her shot btw) I think this would have worked better if his t-shirt had been all light grey. As it stands, it ''mixes in'' with your dress half-way down. The lighting is a bit harsh as well, especially on the left of the man. Was this on-camera flash? Good idea though, and it was a refreshing change from the other entries in the challenge.', '2005-11-28 22:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
