(1905942, 259735, 6349, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  I hoped this would ribbon when I saw it.  I find it very interesting that this was done with kids.  It gives it a whole other level of interest that I don''t think would have worked with adults about coming of age and loss of innocence and all that...</td>', 'Congrats!  I hoped this would ribbon when I saw it.  I find it very interesting that this was done with kids.  It gives it a whole other level of interest that I don''t think would have worked with adults about coming of age and loss of innocence and all that...', '2005-11-29 23:41:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1906177, 258591, 42849, '<td valign="top">I love this shot....But there''s more here than what meets the eye... As I was browsing the results, I got up and as I returned, I glanced at the full-screen image from about 10-15 feet away and, well, try it... I think you''ll see what I mean.... If the effect was planned, I''d love to know how you chose the exposure.  If not, well, sometimes things just go right.</td>', 'I love this shot....But there''s more here than what meets the eye... As I was browsing the results, I got up and as I returned, I glanced at the full-screen image from about 10-15 feet away and, well, try it... I think you''ll see what I mean.... If the effect was planned, I''d love to know how you chose the exposure.  If not, well, sometimes things just go right.', '2005-11-30 00:53:48.000000', NULL, 0),
